% Data codewords of the supplement, not the host

{
    (0|Mesa) (host=code128 debugcws) aztecmesas
} [ 29 48 53 1 47 ] debugIsEqual


% Smoke tests

{
    0 0 moveto (0123456789|This is Aztec Mesas) (host=code128 twosided layers=2) aztecmesas true
} true isEqual
(C|Mesa) (host=code39 hostwidenarrow=3 dontdraw) ok_tmpl
